<title>USA: Avondale to withdraw 3.0 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>Avondale to withdraw 3.0 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avondale Industries Inc said Thursday it will withdraw a proposed three million share offering because of current market conditions.</p>
<p>The registration statement, filed last month, covered 2,950,000 shares to be sold by the company's employee stock ownership plan (ESOP) and the remainder to be offered by the company.</p>
<p>Avondale said the trustees for the ESOP requested the company withdraw the offering.</p>
<p>Avondale designs, builds and overhauls both military and commercial ships.</p>
